    m_Localized: "\xAB+5%\xBB \u2014 i\u015F haqini o\u015Firi\u015F, \xAB\xD6qiti\u015F\xBB \u2014 {0} turadigan kurs (+tajriba), \xAB\u2715\xBB \u2014 i\u015Fdan b\xF6\u015Fati\u015F. \u25CF \u2014 dastgohda i\u015Flaydi."
