    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405251
    m_Localized: "Maqsadlar (muddat {0} oy, \xF6ti\u015F balli {1}):"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405252
    m_Localized: "bar\xE7a mahsulotlar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405253
    m_Localized: "Top\u015Firiqni bo\u015Fla\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405254
    m_Localized: 'Joriy ball: 100 dan {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405255
    m_Localized: "Top\u015Firiq bajarildi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405256
    m_Localized: "Top\u015Firiq bajarilmadi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405257
    m_Localized: "Ball {0} (\xF6ti\u015F balli {1})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405258
    m_Localized: "Sexda qoli\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405259
    m_Localized: 'Qolgan oylar: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405260
    m_Localized: "hozir {0} \u2192 {1} ball"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405261
    m_Localized: "Ball {0} dan past b\xF6lmasa, top\u015Firiq bajarilgan hisoblanadi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405262
    m_Localized: "Kamida {0} dona i\u015Flab \xE7iqari\u015F ({1})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405263
    m_Localized: "Nuqson {0}% dan o\u015Fmasin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405264
    m_Localized: "Sexdagi yuklar y\xF6lini {0}% ga qisqartiri\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405265
    m_Localized: "Ombor to\u015Fib ketmasin (to\u015Fgan kunlar: {0})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405266
    m_Localized: "Qaytarilgan nuqsonli mahsulot {0} dan o\u015Fmasin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405267
    m_Localized: "Buzili\u015F va TX tufayli bekor turi\u015F {0} soatdan o\u015Fmasin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405268
    m_Localized: "Bozor ulu\u015Fi kamida {0}% ({1})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405269
    m_Localized: "Federatsiya tenderida \u011Folib \xE7iqi\u015F va \u015Fartnomani \xF6z vaqtida yopi\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405270
    m_Localized: "Birin\xE7i sex"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405271
    m_Localized: "Sex quring va birin\xE7i doboklarni \xE7iqaring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405272
    m_Localized: "Sizda b\xF6\u015F sex va 80 mln s\xF6m bor. Bi\xE7i\u015F va tiki\u015F zonalarini b\xF6yang, dastgohlarni q\xF6ying, bi\xE7uv\xE7i, tikuv\xE7i va yordam\xE7i i\u015F\xE7ini i\u015Fga oling, paxta va ip buyurtma qiling, reja va narxni belgilang. Maqsad \u2014 ikki oyda ortiq\xE7a nuqsonsiz kamida 250 ta dobok \xE7iqari\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405273
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: zonani si\xE7qon\xE7ani tortib \xE7izing, dastgohni \xF6z zonasi i\xE7iga y\xF6lakka qaratib q\xF6ying. \xABXodimlar\xBB ekranida \xABOperatorlarni joyla\u015F\xBB tugmasi bor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405274
    m_Localized: Logistika va ombor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405275
    m_Localized: "Yuklar kamroq ta\u015Fili\u015Fi u\xE7un dastgohlarni k\xF6\xE7iring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405276
    m_Localized: "Sex i\u015Flayapti, lekin dastgohlar zonalarning uzoq \xE7etida turibdi va yordam\xE7i i\u015F\xE7ilar vaqtni y\xF6lga sarflaydi. Dastgohlarni omborga va bir-biriga yaqinroq k\xF6\xE7iring, javonlar, uzati\u015F tomoni va transport partiyasini sozlang. Maqsad \u2014 yuklar y\xF6lini 30% ga qisqartiri\u015F va i\u015Flab \xE7iqari\u015Fni y\xF6qotmasdan omborni to\u015Firmaslik."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405277
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: \xABSex\xBB ekranida spagetti diagrammasini yoqing \u2014 qizil kataklar eng band y\xF6laklarni k\xF6rsatadi. \xABK\xF6\xE7iri\u015F\xBB asbobi tanlangan dastgohni k\xF6\xE7iradi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405278
    m_Localized: Sifat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405279
    m_Localized: "Nuqsonni kamaytiring va qaytari\u015Flarni y\xF6qoting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405280
    m_Localized: "Sex tejamkor yi\u011Filgan: sifat nazorati stoli va nazorat\xE7i y\xF6q, xaridorlar esa nuqsonli mahsulotni qaytarmoqda. Sifat nazorati stolini q\xF6ying, nazorat\xE7ini i\u015Fga oling, xoma\u015Fyo kiri\u015F nazoratini yoqing, topilgan nuqson bilan nima qili\u015Fni tanlang, odamlarni \xF6qiting. Maqsad \u2014 ikki oyda nuqson 2,5% dan o\u015Fmasligi va birorta ham qaytari\u015F b\xF6lmasligi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405281
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: sifat nazorati nuqsonni sotuvdan oldin topadi, kiri\u015F nazorati esa yomon xoma\u015Fyoni sexga kirgizmaydi. \xC7ar\xE7agan va tajribasiz odamlar k\xF6proq xato qiladi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405282
    m_Localized: Uskunalar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405283
    m_Localized: "Dastgohlar eskirgan \u2014 ularning buzili\u015Figa y\xF6l q\xF6ymang."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405284
    m_Localized: "Siz eski dastgohli sex sotib oldingiz: ularning holati taxminan 1%. Sozlov\xE7isiz rejali TX qilinmaydi, buzili\u015F esa dastgohni uzoq vaqtga t\xF6xtatadi. Sozlov\xE7ini i\u015Fga oling, TX reglamentini belgilang, pul yetsa IoT dat\xE7iklari va ba\u015Foratli TXni ulang. Bu top\u015Firiqda qolipla\u015F va dubul\u011Falar o\xE7iladi. Maqsad \u2014 u\xE7 oyda buzili\u015F va TX tufayli bekor turi\u015F 2 soatdan o\u015Fmasligi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933092405285
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: bir-ikki smenada sozlov\xE7i TXni smenalar orasida, bekor turi\u015Fsiz qiladi. \xABHar 1 operatsiyada TX\xBB reglamenti dastgohni darhol TXga yuboradi \u2014 keyin odatiysini qaytaring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793856
    m_Localized: "Bozor va raqobat\xE7ilar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793857
    m_Localized: "Daebo va Ab\u0131dasdan bozor ulu\u015Fini yutib oling."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793858
    m_Localized: "Bozorga raqobat\xE7ilar \xE7iqdi: Daebo qimmat va sifatli, Ab\u0131das esa arzon sotadi. Xaridorlar narx, sifat va obr\xF6ga qarab tanlaydi. Narxlar va rejani bo\u015Fqaring, reklamaga sarmoya kiriting, turnirlarga homiylik qiling, ambassador bilan \u015Fartnoma imzolang. Maqsad \u2014 oxirgi oyda bozor ulu\u015Fi kamida 33%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793859
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: mahsulot yetmasa, sotuv raqobat\xE7ilarga ketadi. \xABSotuv\xBB ekranida boy berilgan sotuvlarni kuzating."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793860
    m_Localized: "\u015Eartnomalar va \xF6si\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793861
    m_Localized: "Federatsiya tenderida \u011Folib \xE7iqing va \u015Fartnomani \xF6z vaqtida bajaring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793862
    m_Localized: "Mintaqaviy taekvondo federatsiyasi ikki oyda yetkazib beri\u015F \u015Farti bilan 200 ta dobokka tender e\u02BClon qildi. Birin\xE7i oyda ariza bering, i\u015Flab \xE7iqari\u015Fni o\u015Firing, kerak b\xF6lsa kredit oling, mahsulotni sertifikatlang, raqamla\u015Ftiri\u015F modullarini joriy eting. Maqsad \u2014 \u015Fartnomani ke\xE7iktirmasdan yopi\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793863
    m_Localized: "Maslahat: arizalar oy oxiriga\xE7a qabul qilinadi, eng yuqori ball \u011Folib b\xF6ladi \u2014 narx, obr\xF6, sifat tarixi. \u015Eartnoma b\xF6yi\xE7a yetkazib beri\u015Flar \xE7akana savdodan oldin ketadi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793864
    m_Localized: "U\xE7 yil yakunlari"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793865
    m_Localized: "Kapitalizatsiya b\xF6yi\xE7a reyting. \xD6yinni muddatsiz davom ettiri\u015F mumkin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793866
    m_Localized: "Kompaniya bankrot b\xF6ldi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793867
    m_Localized: bankrot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 330933100793868
    m_Localized: "Davom ettiri\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
